So grateful to have our daughter, my Ate Ica home for the holidays 🎄 We picked her up at 2AM this morning after her last performance at Disney’s Magic Kingdom.  She went straight to the airport, faced a long delay, and arrived beyond exhausted. Our hearts are full knowing she’s finally home, resting, and spending the holidays with family. ❤️
Merry Christmas 🎄🤶🎁 everyone 😘
