THANK YOU 💛
 To everyone who came out for our first Friendsgiving Bake Sale — thank you for being part of it. 🫶🏻

We gathered 31 chefs, 10 artists, a florist, and 15 volunteers inside an 8,000 sqft space… and together served 3,000 pastries, packed 800+ pastry boxes, and welcomed 1,000+ guests. Everything sold out in just five hours.

Thank you to every vendor who brought so much care and love, and to our 10 partners for helping us build the table, light the space, and fill our donation bags.
 And thank you to our volunteers who kept the day moving with so much patience and joy.

Because of you, we were also able to support York Street Project (@yorkstreetproject) this Thanksgiving — and contribute to food donation efforts in Jersey City. 

This was our first time doing something on this scale, and your kindness made the whole day feel so easy and hopeful. We’re already thinking about the next one, and we can’t wait to gather with you again! 

More highlights on chefs, partners and food drive to follow in the days to come!

Happy Thanksgiving🫶🏻💕

